cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "geomech: symbolic equations of motion on smooth manifolds"
abstract: >-
  geomech derives coordinate-free equations of motion for mechanical systems on R, R³,
  S¹, S², SO(3) and their products from a Lagrangian and virtual work, including models
  with a symbolic number of bodies, checks them numerically, linearizes them along
  trajectories, generates NumPy and CasADi code, simulates them with a Lie-group
  integrator, and renders them as 3-D reports.
authors:
  - family-names: Kotaru
    given-names: Prasanth
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6608-7469"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vkotaru/geomech"
url: "https://github.com/vkotaru/geomech"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - geometric mechanics
  - equations of motion
  - symbolic computation
  - robotics
  - SO(3)
  - S2
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-17"
